---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Future Shock Media — Boring on purpose"
description: "Podcast and publication. Boring on purpose."
ogTitle: "Future Shock Media — Boring on purpose"
ogDescription: "Podcast and publication. Boring on purpose."
---
<header class="masthead" role="banner">
  <div class="container masthead-inner">
    <h1 class="masthead-wordmark" aria-label="{{ site.title }}">
      <span class="wordmark-line">Future</span>
      <span class="wordmark-line">Shock</span>
      <span class="wordmark-line">Media</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="masthead-tagline">{{ site.subtitle }}</p>

    <p class="masthead-about">This is a podcast and publication for our community. We&rsquo;re inspired by the Alvin Toffler book by the same name. The lessons are about learning and adaptability, and playing the long game by being boring on purpose.</p>

    <div class="masthead-subscribe">
      <form class="subscribe-form subscribe-form--hero" data-action="{{ site.subscribeApiBase }}/api/subscribe" data-source="{{ site.subscribeSource }}" novalidate>
        <label class="sr-only" for="subscribe-email">Email</label>
        <input class="subscribe-input" type="email" id="subscribe-email" name="email" placeholder="Your email" required autocomplete="email">
        <input class="subscribe-hp" type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true">
        <button type="submit" class="subscribe-submit">Subscribe &rarr;</button>
      </form>
    </div>

    <nav class="masthead-index" aria-label="Sections">
      <ol class="index-list">
        {% for item in navigation %}
        <li class="index-item">
          <a href="{{ item.url }}" class="index-link">
            <span class="mono index-num">{{ item.num }}</span>
            <span class="index-label">{{ item.label }}</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
        <li class="index-item index-item--social" aria-label="Social media links">
          <div class="index-social-links">
            <a class="index-social-link" href="https://www.youtube.com/@FutureShockMe" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Future Shock Media on YouTube">
              <svg class="social-icon social-icon--brand" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <path d="M23.5 6.2a3 3 0 0 0-2.1-2.1C19.5 3.6 12 3.6 12 3.6s-7.5 0-9.4.5A3 3 0 0 0 .5 6.2 31.4 31.4 0 0 0 0 12a31.4 31.4 0 0 0 .5 5.8 3 3 0 0 0 2.1 2.1c1.9.5 9.4.5 9.4.5s7.5 0 9.4-.5a3 3 0 0 0 2.1-2.1A31.4 31.4 0 0 0 24 12a31.4 31.4 0 0 0-.5-5.8ZM9.6 15.6V8.4L15.8 12l-6.2 3.6Z" />
              </svg>
            </a>
            <a class="index-social-link" href="https://www.instagram.com/futureshock.media/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Future Shock Media on Instagram">
              <svg class="social-icon social-icon--brand social-icon--square" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <path d="M7 1h10a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v10a6 6 0 0 1-6 6H7a6 6 0 0 1-6-6V7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6Zm.1 2A4.1 4.1 0 0 0 3 7.1v9.8A4.1 4.1 0 0 0 7.1 21h9.8a4.1 4.1 0 0 0 4.1-4.1V7.1A4.1 4.1 0 0 0 16.9 3H7.1Zm10.15 2.4a1.35 1.35 0 1 1 0 2.7 1.35 1.35 0 0 1 0-2.7ZM12 6.8a5.2 5.2 0 1 1 0 10.4 5.2 5.2 0 0 1 0-10.4Zm0 2a3.2 3.2 0 1 0 0 6.4 3.2 3.2 0 0 0 0-6.4Z" />
              </svg>
            </a>
            <a class="index-social-link" href="https://x.com/futureshockme" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Future Shock Media on X">
              <svg class="social-icon social-icon--brand social-icon--square" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <path d="M17.8 1h3.7l-8.1 9.25L22.9 23h-7.2l-5.6-7.35L3.65 23H0l8.75-10L.15 1h7.3l5.05 6.7L17.8 1Zm-1.3 20h2.05L5.45 2.9H3.25L16.5 21Z" />
              </svg>
            </a>
            <a class="index-social-link" href="https://bsky.app/profile/futureshock.media" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Future Shock Media on Bluesky">
              <svg class="social-icon social-icon--brand social-icon--bsky" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <path d="M5.4 3.5C8 5.4 10.8 9.3 12 11.4c1.2-2.1 4-6 6.6-7.9 1.9-1.4 5-2.5 5 1 0 .7-.4 5.7-.7 6.5-.8 2.8-3.8 3.5-6.5 3.1 4.7.8 5.9 3.4 3.3 6-4.8 4.9-6.9-1.2-7.4-2.8-.1-.3-.2-.5-.3-.5s-.2.2-.3.5c-.5 1.6-2.6 7.7-7.4 2.8-2.6-2.6-1.4-5.2 3.3-6-2.7.4-5.7-.3-6.5-3.1C.8 10.2.4 5.2.4 4.5c0-3.5 3.1-2.4 5-1Z" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="home">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="home-split">
      <section id="guest" class="section section--guests">
        <h2 class="section-head"><span class="mono section-num">§03</span> Guest guide</h2>
        <ul class="link-stack">
          <li><a href="/guest-request/">Be our guest</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guest-guide/">Guest guide</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guest-pre-interview/">Pre-interview questionnaire</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section id="hosts" class="section section--hosts">
        <h2 class="section-head"><span class="mono section-num">§04</span> Hosts</h2>
        <details class="host">
          <summary class="host-name mono">01 &middot; Pardis</summary>
          <div class="host-body">
            <p>Pardis is the founder and CEO of General Folders, a company pioneering secure data transfer solutions for enterprises. Previously, she led data science teams at Twitter and Carbon Health, building products with the customer in mind.</p>
            <p>In her free time, you&rsquo;ll find her watching Giants games or writing about the lessons learned from startup life.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="host">
          <summary class="host-name mono">02 &middot; Jenni</summary>
          <div class="host-body">
            <p>Jenni is a host on Future Shock Media, bringing years of experience closing deals and building sales teams from the ground up. She has an uncanny ability to build community and strong relationships.</p>
            <p>Her network spans founders, VCs, and operators. She&rsquo;ll share the real mechanics of how deals get done, beyond the surface-level advice that fills most business books.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </section>
    </div>

  </div>
</main>
